{"id":"886d3e2a93a3e218","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md","title":"Primitive Recursion Operator $\\mathrm{PrimRec}$","display":"df-primrec-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator $\\mathrm{PrimRec}$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-primrec-operator","aliases":["58-df-primrec-operator","58-df-PrimRec"],"display":"df-primrec-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator $\\mathrm{PrimRec}$","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-primrec-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-primrec-operator</span><span>58-df-PrimRec</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primrec-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>（总元数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\omega^{n-1}\\to\\omega\">\\(g:\\omega^{n-1}\\to\\omega\\)</span>（基础函数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\omega^{n+1}\\to\\omega\">\\(h:\\omega^{n+1}\\to\\omega\\)</span>（递推函数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega^n\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega^n\\to\\omega\\)</span>（目标函数；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{x} = \\langle x_0, \\ldots, x_{n-2}\\rangle \\in \\omega^{n-1}\">\\(\\vec{x} = \\langle x_0, \\ldots, x_{n-2}\\rangle \\in \\omega^{n-1}\\)</span> (前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-1\">\\(n-1\\)</span> 个参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y \\in \\omega\">\\(y \\in \\omega\\)</span> (递归变量)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_n\\)</span>（本文件定义的、显式记录元数的原始递归算子）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a\\rangle\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,a\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\langle a\\rangle\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,a\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的函数列，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{\\langle k,a\\rangle\\}\">\\(s^{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{\\langle k,a\\rangle\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primrec\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimRec}_n(g,h)=f \\leftrightarrow\\left(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land g:\\omega^{n-1}\\to\\omega\\land h:\\omega^{n+1}\\to\\omega\\land f:\\omega^n\\to\\omega\\land\\forall\\vec{x}\\in\\omega^{n-1}\\;(f(\\vec{x}^{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle)=g(\\vec{x})\\land\\forall y\\in\\omega\\;(f(\\vec{x}^{\\frown}\\langle y+1\\rangle)=h(\\vec{x}^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle^{\\frown}\\langle f(\\vec{x}^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\rangle)))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primrec\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimRec}_n(g,h)=f \\leftrightarrow\\left(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land g:\\omega^{n-1}\\to\\omega\\land h:\\omega^{n+1}\\to\\omega\\land f:\\omega^n\\to\\omega\\land\\forall\\vec{x}\\in\\omega^{n-1}\\;(f(\\vec{x}^{\\frown}\\langle0\\rangle)=g(\\vec{x})\\land\\forall y\\in\\omega\\;(f(\\vec{x}^{\\frown}\\langle y+1\\rangle)=h(\\vec{x}^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle^{\\frown}\\langle f(\\vec{x}^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\rangle)))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\)</span>：原始递归算子，通过初始函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 和递归函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元函数</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g, h \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(g, h \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g, h) \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g, h) \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></li>\n<li>该等式模式唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h\">\\(g,h\\)</span> 原始递归时，闭包性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 原始递归。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resol